# Variant b — a mid-priced executor with the frontier model as its advisor, for every
# untagged (mid) step: the advisor is consulted on the approach and before finishing.
# The executor stays at medium — a low-effort executor stops asking its advisor.
# Tagged steps keep their tier, so a `model: strong` step is identical under a and b.
# Protocol and decision rule: scripts/plan-runner/benchmark.md
MODEL_MID=opus
EFFORT_MID=medium
ADVISOR_MID=fable
JUDGE_MODEL=opus
JUDGE_EFFORT=high
